WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.907
Aapki home screen: aaj ka focus, streak aur aage kya karna hai.

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:11.913
Counter se mili Library ID daalkar apni library join karein.

00:00:12.013 --> 00:00:17.914
Apni seat, shift, plan aur membership kab khatam hogi, dekhein.

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:23.917
Ek tap mein punch in, sirf library ke andar se.

00:00:24.017 --> 00:00:29.930
Focus session shuru karein. Samay server par gina jaata hai, aur XP milta hai.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:35.929
Daily quests chhote goals dete hain jo streak chalti rakhte hain.

00:00:36.029 --> 00:00:41.943
Syllabus, mock tests aur revision ke saath exam ki taiyaari karein.

00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:47.953
Apni sign-in aur security settings yahan sambhalein.
